comment10.target=void\ revertRegularMember(java.lang.String)
comment10.text=\r\n\ Resets\ the\ member\ to\ the\ default\ regular\ state\ and\ stores\ the\ removal\ reason.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ removalReason\ The\ reason\ for\ removing\ the\ member.\r\n
